            <description><![CDATA[
<h2>What's New in StockDeck 1.1.19</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Cross-market ticker search:</strong> Search results now distinguish US NET (Cloudflare) from HNX NET (CTCP Bột giặt Net), while the Vietnamese ticker remains displayed as NET.</li>
    <li><strong>Watchlist picker:</strong> Existing symbols stay visible in search and can be removed by selecting them again.</li>
    <li><strong>Market-aware logos:</strong> Search result logos now use the result's exchange so similarly named tickers show the correct company logo.</li>
</ul>
